<v Man>I thought about it. I was like, I bet selling life insurance is way easier than this. Or like, those guys who sell scissors, go door to door. Like Cutco. They sell scissors. I'm like, I'm sure I could sell some scissors.
<v Man>我想过这个问题。我心想，我打赌卖人寿保险比这个简单多了。或者那些挨家挨户卖剪刀的家伙。比如Cutco。他们卖剪刀。我心想，我肯定能卖出一些剪刀。

00:57:23.290 --> 00:57:55.030
